    <detaileddescription>
<para>&quot;ModelProto is a top-level file/container format for bundling a ML model and &quot; &quot;associating its computation graph with metadata. The semantics of the model &quot; &quot;are described by the associated GraphProto&apos;s.&quot; <linebreak/>
 </para>
